  },{
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 3,
    "name": "Modular Kitchen Cost",
    "item": "https://siddhivinayakdesigners.in/blog/modular-kitchen-cost-per-sq-ft"
  }]
}
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "mainEntityOfPage": {
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "@id": "https://siddhivinayakdesigners.in/blog/modular-kitchen-cost-per-sq-ft"
  },
  "headline": "Modular Kitchen Cost Per Sq. Ft. in 2026: Everything You Need to Know",
  "description": "Everything you need to know about modular kitchen cost per square foot in 2026. Explore pricing factors, layouts, countertops, materials, and accessories in Navi Mumbai.",
  "image": "https://siddhivinayakdesigners.in/assets/images/modular-kitchen/classic-modular-kitchen-with-granite-countertop-and-hob.webp",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Siddhivinayak Designers"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Siddhivinayak Designers",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://siddhivinayakdesigners.in/assets/images/logo_icon.webp"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-08-18",
  "dateModified": "2026-08-18"
}`;

const bodyContent = `
<!-- Article Header -->
<section class="py-5 bg-light" style="margin-top: 70px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E6E2DB;">
  <div class="container py-4">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-10 text-center">
        <span class="badge bg-secondary text-white mb-3 px-3 py-2">Expert Advice &amp; Pricing</span>
        <h1 class="font-luxury text-dark display-5 mb-3">Modular Kitchen Cost Per Sq. Ft. in 2026: Everything You Need to Know About Pricing</h1>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center gap-4 text-muted small mb-4">
          <span><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt text-gold me-1"></i> August 18, 2026</span>
          <span><i class="far fa-clock text-gold me-1"></i> 8 min read</span>
          <span><i class="fas fa-user text-gold me-1"></i> By Siddhivinayak Team</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Main Article Content -->
<section class="py-5 bg-white">
  <div class="container py-4">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <img alt="Modular Kitchen Cost Guide 2026" class="img-fluid rounded mb-4 shadow" src="/assets/images/modular-kitchen/classic-modular-kitchen-with-granite-countertop-and-hob.webp" style="width:100%; max-height: 450px; object-fit: cover;" />

        <div class="article-body font-body lead-sm text-dark">
          <p class="lead text-dark">For most of us, a home is an investment that we make. However, as all things age, so do our homes, which leads us to renovate them every few years. During these renovations, the first room you’d consider paying attention to is undoubtedly the kitchen. Being a room that receives the maximum amount of traffic, regular maintenance and renovation is a must. By now, the question of what your modular kitchen cost per sq. ft. can amount to is probably on your mind.</p>

          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">So, if you’ve spent many a sleepless night frantically googling “modular kitchen price per sq ft”, we can help put you at ease. For homeowners seeking both style and affordability, our breakdown of modular kitchen designs with price offers valuable insights into achieving the perfect balance. Here’s a simple breakdown of elements and their costs that can go into kitchen renovation costs.</p>

          <h2 class="text-dark font-luxury h3 mt-5 mb-4">Estimated Modular Kitchen Price per Square Foot</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">When planning your renovation, understanding modular kitchen designs with price can help you budget effectively and choose the best options for your space.</p>

          <!-- Pricing Table -->
          <div class="table-responsive mb-5" style="border: 1px solid #E6E2DB; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
            <table class="table table-striped mb-0 align-middle">
              <thead>
                <tr style="background-color: rgba(24, 155, 166, 0.15);">
                  <th scope="col" class="py-3 px-4 font-luxury text-dark" style="border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(24, 155, 166, 0.3);">Element</th>
                  <th scope="col" class="py-3 px-4 font-luxury text-dark" style="border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(24, 155, 166, 0.3); text-align: right;">Estimated Price</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 fw-bold text-dark">Premium Emulsion Paint</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-secondary" style="text-align: right;">Starts from ₹22 to ₹32 per sq. ft.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 fw-bold text-dark">Wood Laminate Cabinet (MDF substrate)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-secondary" style="text-align: right;">₹12,681 per cabinet (avg width 600 mm)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 fw-bold text-dark">Grey Granite Countertop</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-secondary" style="text-align: right;">Starts at ₹570 per sq. ft.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 fw-bold text-dark">Kitchen Tiling (floor and wall backsplash)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-secondary" style="text-align: right;">Starts at ₹150 per sq. ft. (min 50 sq. ft.)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 fw-bold text-dark">Futura Dura Single Bowl Sink (533×437 mm)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-secondary" style="text-align: right;">₹5,125</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">To know the total modular kitchen price per sq. ft. after renovation, just add the total of everything that we have mentioned and make changes as per your requirements.</p>
          <div class="alert alert-info bg-light border-info text-dark mb-5">
            <strong>Note:</strong> Kitchen remodelling prices can vary based on different factors. Be sure to go through the details below for more granular pricing information.
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-dark font-luxury h3 mt-5 mb-3">Primary Elements Affecting Your Modular Kitchen Rate</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Multiple parameters dictate the actual quote and average modular kitchen square feet rate during residential interior contracting projects:</p>

          <ul class="list-unstyled ps-0 mb-5">
            <li class="mb-4 border-bottom pb-3">
              <strong class="text-dark h5 d-block font-luxury mb-2">1. Design and Layout:</strong>
              The selected format (such as L-shape, U-shape, straight, or parallel layout) impacts the total cabinetry length and structural complexity, changing the average modular kitchen cost.
            </li>
            <li class="mb-4 border-bottom pb-3">
              <strong class="text-dark h5 d-block font-luxury mb-2">2. Paint Options:</strong>
              Simple emulsion paint is a cost-effective choice for budget renewals. However, high-durability acrylic emulsion paints are premium, providing stain protection suited for kitchens with heavy cooking traffic.
            </li>
            <li class="mb-4 border-bottom pb-3">
              <strong class="text-dark h5 d-block font-luxury mb-2">3. Cabinet Carcass / Core Material:</strong>
              Your selection of plywood or engineered boards dictates the modular kitchen rate. CenturyPly BWR marine plywood is extremely sturdy, water-proof, and expensive, while MDF/HDF substrates serve as cost-effective core alternatives.
            </li>
            <li class="mb-4 border-bottom pb-3">
              <strong class="text-dark h5 d-block font-luxury mb-2">4. Functionality and Hardware:</strong>
              The quantity of pull-out drawers, shutter doors, hydraulic lift-ups, tall units, and custom drawer organisers directly scales the pricing. Brands like Hettich and Hafele offer lifetime warranty fittings that raise initial costs but increase durability.
            </li>
            <li class="mb-4 border-bottom pb-3">
              <strong class="text-dark h5 d-block font-luxury mb-2">5. Countertop Material:</strong>
              Granite is robust and economical, while premium Quartz stone surfaces are non-porous and highly scratch-resistant but command a higher square foot rate.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <img alt="Modular Kitchen Designs" class="img-fluid rounded mb-5 shadow" src="/assets/images/modular-kitchen/kitchen-cabinets-turquoise-and-off-while-laminates.webp" style="width:100%; max-height: 380px; object-fit: cover;" />

          <h2 class="text-dark font-luxury h3 mt-5 mb-4">Detailed Breakdown of Modular Kitchen Costs</h2>

          <h3 class="text-dark font-luxury h4 mt-4 mb-2">#1: Kitchen Tiling &amp; Backsplash</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Kitchen tiling includes both the floor tiles and the wall backsplash (installed between the base and wall cabinets). To estimate costs, measure the length and width of the kitchen floor, adding 5% to 10% for material cutting waste. For the backsplash wall, measure the perimeter and height from the countertop to the upper cabinetry limit. 
          <br/><strong class="text-gold">Estimated Cost:</strong> Tiling labor and materials start from <strong class="text-dark">₹150 per sq. ft.</strong> (with a minimum site billing area of 50 sq. ft.).</p>

          <h3 class="text-dark font-luxury h4 mt-4 mb-2">#2: Kitchen Painting</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Using special emulsion paint prevents moisture absorption and stains. You can opt for single or dual-tone shades to create contrast. Emulsion painting is durable and keeps the interior budget-friendly.
          <br/><strong class="text-gold">Estimated Cost:</strong> Premium kitchen emulsion painting ranges between <strong class="text-dark">₹22 to ₹32 per sq. ft.</strong> plus GST.</p>

          <h3 class="text-dark font-luxury h4 mt-4 mb-2">#3: Kitchen Cabinetry (Carcass &amp; Shutters)</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Cabinetry constitutes the main expense in a kitchen design. It comprises the modular carcass panels and outer shutters. Total cabinet costs vary based on storage preferences (Tambour units, pull-out tall units, and standard drawers). For example, premium high-gloss acrylic shutter finishes cost more than traditional matte laminates.
          <br/><strong class="text-gold">Estimated Cost:</strong> A standard single-door cabinet (width 600 mm) in wood laminate finish with an MDF carcass substrate costs around <strong class="text-dark">₹12,681</strong> on average.</p>

          <h3 class="text-dark font-luxury h4 mt-4 mb-2">#4: Kitchen Countertops</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Indian cooking demands robust countertops to handle direct heat, heavy utensils, and oil stains. Common materials include granite, quartz stone, and marble. Granite is economical and durable, while quartz provides a clean modern look without porosity issues.
          <br/><strong class="text-gold">Estimated Cost:</strong> High-durability Grey Granite slabs start at <strong class="text-dark">₹570 per sq. ft.</strong></p>

          <h3 class="text-dark font-luxury h4 mt-4 mb-2">#5: Kitchen Sink &amp; Plumbing</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Select single or double bowl layouts depending on space and utility. Sinks can include vegetable drainer trays and premium satin-finished surfaces that resist hard water staining.
          <br/><strong class="text-gold">Estimated Cost:</strong> Futura Dura Single Bowl Sink (dimensions 533×437 mm) with Satin Finish is priced at <strong class="text-dark">₹5,125</strong>.</p>

          <h3 class="text-dark font-luxury h4 mt-4 mb-2">#6: Electricals &amp; Light Systems</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Ensure safe routing of power cables to support appliances like heavy refrigerators, ovens, chimneys, and microwaves. Wiring layout and profile LED lights under overhead cabinets should be planned during the carcass drafting phase. Electrical installation costs vary based on wire length and lighting style.</p>

          <h3 class="text-dark font-luxury h4 mt-4 mb-2">#7: Modular Kitchen Accessories</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">Integrating intelligent organizers optimizes kitchen storage and usage. Key components include:</p>
          <ul class="mb-5 text-dark">
            <li class="mb-2">Soft-close drawers and cutlery divider organizers</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Stainless steel Thali baskets and cup-and-saucer layouts</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Bottle pull-outs for condiments and spices</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Corner swing-out trays (Magic Corner / Lemans corner systems)</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Built-in cabinet dustbins and detergent racks</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-dark font-luxury h3 mt-5 mb-3">Popular Layout Formats</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">The layout determines the workflow of the kitchen (adhering to the classic Work Triangle rule):</p>
          <ul class="list-unstyled ps-0 mb-5 text-dark">
            <li class="mb-3"><strong class="text-dark font-luxury">Parallel / Galley Layout:</strong> Features two counters parallel to each other with a walking corridor in the middle. Offers excellent workspace separation.</li>
            <li class="mb-3"><strong class="text-dark font-luxury">U-Shaped Layout:</strong> Surrounds the user on three adjacent walls, perfect for large apartments requiring extensive cabinetry.</li>
            <li class="mb-3"><strong class="text-dark font-luxury">L-Shaped Layout:</strong> Aligns cabinets on two perpendicular walls. Perfect for compact spaces and open floor layouts.</li>
            <li class="mb-3"><strong class="text-dark font-luxury">Island Kitchen:</strong> Features an independent central counter space, acting as a workspace divider or breakfast bar in luxury duplexes.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-dark font-luxury h3 mt-5 mb-4">Pros &amp; Cons of a Modular Kitchen</h2>
          
          <div class="row mb-5 text-dark">
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
              <div class="p-4 rounded h-100" style="background-color: rgba(24, 155, 166, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(24, 155, 166, 0.2);">
                <h4 class="font-luxury text-dark h5 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-plus-circle text-success me-2"></i>Advantages</h4>
                <ul class="small ps-3 text-secondary">
                  <li class="mb-2">Maximizes storage utilizing tall organizers, corner pull-outs, and skirting drawers.</li>
                  <li class="mb-2">Customizable with a wide range of colors, textures, and finish materials (acrylic, laminate, PU).</li>
                  <li class="mb-2">Factory production ensures perfect alignment, smooth edge-banding, and quick on-site assembly.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
              <div class="p-4 rounded h-100" style="background-color: rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.2);">
                <h4 class="font-luxury text-dark h5 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-minus-circle text-danger me-2"></i>Disadvantages</h4>
                <ul class="small ps-3 text-secondary">
                  <li class="mb-2">Requires higher initial setup investment than basic site-made carpentry projects.</li>
                  <li class="mb-2">Replacing a damaged component later requires finding a matching finish batch.</li>
                  <li class="mb-2">Requires precise civil pre-planning of plumbing and gas pipelines.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-dark font-luxury h3 mt-5 mb-3">Why Choose Siddhivinayak Designers for Your Modular Kitchen?</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-dark">With over 25 years of local contracting experience in Navi Mumbai, we construct kitchens designed to last. We utilize genuine <strong class="text-dark">IS:710 Boiling Water Proof (BWP) marine plywood</strong> to protect your kitchen against monsoon humidity. All modular cabinet fittings are backed by warranty parameters and processed using factory machines for seamless edge protection.</p>

          <a href="/kitchen-calculator" class="btn btn-gold btn-lg w-100 py-3 font-luxury my-4">Calculate Your Kitchen Cost Instantly</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
`;
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} schema={schema}>
  <Fragment set:html={bodyContent} />
</Layout>
